sql-local
=========

All files authored for this package (MIT): app.py, ui.html, goal-prompt.md, seed.py, selftest.py, setup.sh, README.md.
No third-party code is bundled. Python standard library only (sqlite3). Optional database drivers
(psycopg, pymysql) are installed by the operator and are not part of this package.
sample/research.db is synthetic dummy data generated by seed.py.
